# Rotifer Gene Development

## Gene Structure

Every Gene must have:
- `phenotype.json` — metadata (name, domain, fidelity, version, schemas)
- `SKILL.md` — human-readable instructions
- Source files — TypeScript/JavaScript implementation

## Fidelity Types

| Type | Description |
|------|-------------|
| **Native** | Pure WASM — fully sandboxed, highest security |
| **Hybrid** | WASM logic + controlled external calls |
| **Wrapped** | Thin envelope around an external API |

## Naming Convention

- Gene names: lowercase kebab-case (`web-scraper`, `code-formatter`)
- Domains: dot-separated hierarchy (`code.format`, `search.web`)
